{
  "app_id": 4908560,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Take charge of a men’s volleyball club in Setter: Volleyball Manager 27 , a single-player management game. Build your squad, shape your tactics and lead your club through every season. Scout talent, negotiate transfers and contracts, and find the right balance of skill and experience. Build a squad that fits your playing style and your budget. Study your opponents, exploit their weaknesses and prepare your team to compete. Choose where to apply pressure, how much risk to take and when to change your approach. Follow matches point by point, read the momentum and make tactical changes when they matter most. Take charge yourself or use instant results to keep your career moving. Plan training, develop your players and manage your transfer budget and wage bill. Stay on top of club expectations, fixtures and decisions through your calendar and inbox. Develop young talent, replace key players and keep your squad competitive as seasons unfold. Chase domestic titles and European success while building for the future. Play in the included volleyball world, create a fictional setting or bring in your own competition data. Choose your club and start writing its next chapter."
  },
